{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1241483-dead-wolves","id":1241483,"title":"Dead wolves","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-01T13:50:16-07:00","id":1241483,"title":"Dead wolves","content":"So I'm continuing to write a story/ fanfiction and need some help. I was wondering if dead wolves the vampire bloodline is wholly Mexican? <br /> <br /> What I mean is ,are kindred who are bloodline members only of Mexican birth and as well are potentially childer only Mexican?<br /> My story involves a few crossovers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24308-vargrskol","name":"Vargrskol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T14:34:21-07:00","id":1241498,"title":"","content":"Even if they were in their official 1E writeup, no need for them to be so in 2E homebrews.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-01T19:18:04-07:00","id":1241629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vargrskol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1241483-dead-wolves#post1241483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm continuing to write a story/ fanfiction and need some help. I was wondering if dead wolves the vampire bloodline is wholly Mexican?<br /> <br /> What I mean is ,are kindred who are bloodline members only of Mexican birth and as well are potentially childer only Mexican?<br /> My story involves a few crossovers</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know if this will be of any interest to you, as it's essentially headcanon/houserules, but either way.<br /> For my own purposes, I have it down that the Mexican Dead Wolves are remnants of a far older Roman Bloodline (called the 'Larentii') that was primarily Julii, but could take Gangrel members. I was inspired by the fact that Romulus was a Werewolf according to Dark Eras, which would mean that Remus would have been Wolf-Blooded at least.<br /> I wasn't sure how the Bloodline would become so tied to Mexico in this little idea, but I thought it fit and liked giving them a bit of secret history.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}